F. Model Architecture Details
Input: 128x128 RGB images (standardized for computation)
Convolutional Blocks: 4 blocks with increasing filter sizes (32, 64 128 128)
Activation Functions: ReLU for layers and Softmax for the output layer
Pooling: MaxPooling2D is used for dimensionality reduction
Optimizer: Adam with a learning rate of 1e-4
Loss Function: Categorical cross-entropy
Metrics: Accuracy, Precision and Recall
Callbacks:EarlyStopping with patience 3 ModelCheckpoint that saves the model by validation accuracy and ReduceLROnPlateau with a factor of 0.5 and patience 2

G. Dataset Specifications
Source: PlantVillage dataset ( available for research)
Training Images: 43,596 images (80% training with augmentation 20% validation without augmentation)
Test Images: 10,709 images (no augmentation, real-world conditions)
Classes:38 disease conditions across 14 crop species
Image Format: RGB resized to 128x128 pixels



